  "description": "MCP server for KakaoTalk messages: send to self or friends via Kakao Developers message API, friends list, OAuth with auto-refresh. 카카오톡 메시지 MCP 서버.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "dist/index.js",
  "types": "dist/index.d.ts",
